# NASA Photo Gallery App (APOD)

## Overview
iOS app that displays NASA’s Astronomy Picture of the Day using NASA’s public API.

## Features
- Fetch APOD by date
- Image & video support
- Full-screen image viewer with zoom
- Error handling & loading states
- Dark Mode support (if implemented)

## Tech Stack
- Swift
- UIKit / SwiftUI
- URLSession
- MVVM (or whatever you used)

## Setup
1. Clone the repo
2. Open `.xcodeproj` or `.xcworkspace`
3. Add your NASA API key in:
   - `Constants.swift` (or wherever)
4. Run on iOS Simulator or device

## API
https://api.nasa.gov/planetary/apod
